clone-lab/

# Per-machine agent and editor tooling. None of it is part of the app, and all of it was
# untracked AND unignored, so a single `git add -A` would have committed it — 84 files on
# 2026-09-19. .agents/ holds third-party skills installed by `npx skills` (3.7 MB, recorded
# in skills-lock.json); .qwen/ is Qwen Code's settings, symlinks into .agents/ and its
# session scratch; .vscode/ is personal editor and MCP config. Tracked agent skills that
# belong to the project live under .claude/skills/ instead.
.agents/
.qwen/
.vscode/
skills-lock.json
